            ],
            "type": "paragraph"
          },
          {
            "children": [
              {
                "text": "Thrust Areas"
              }
            ],
            "type": "heading_four"
          },
          {
            "children": [
              {
                "text": "The Mission will focus on the following Thrust Areas:"
              }
            ],
            "type": "paragraph"
          },
          {
            "children": [
              {
                "text": ""
