            ],
            "type": "block_quote"
          },
          {
            "children": [
              {
                "children": [
                  {
                    "text": "To ensure a steady flow of skilled worker to the industries in different trades."
                  }
                ],
                "type": "list_item"
              },
              {
                "children": [
                  {
                    "text": "To raise the quality and quantity of the industrial production by systematic training of potential workers."
