        "briefDescription": "The scheme is intended for providing Financial Grant for conducting a Study Tour of ATAL TUNNEL\nby Students / faculty of AICTE approved Institutions in the field of technical education.",
        "detailedDescription": [
          {
            "children": [
              {
                "children": [
                  {
                    "text": "AICTE has launched a new scheme namely ,AICTE YOUTH UNDERTAKING VISIT FOR ACQUTRING KNOWLEDGE (YUVAK) STUDY TOUR OF ATAL TUNNEL, HIMACHAL PRADESH, on 21"
                  },
                  {
                    "superscript": true,
                    "text": "st "
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "May 2021 to provide financial grants to the team of one faculty and 10 students from AICTE approved institutions for the study tour of ATAL TUNNEL."
