                ],
                "type": "paragraph"
              },
              {
                "children": [
                  {
                    "bold": true,
                    "text": "Objectives:"
                  }
                ],
                "type": "block_quote"
              },
              {
                "children": [
                  {
                    "children": [
                      {
                        "text": "Assist coconut growers in insuring coconut palms, against natural and other perils."
                      }
                    ],
                    "type": "list_item"
                  },
                  {
                    "children": [
                      {
                        "text": "Provide timely relief to farmers, who suffer income loss due to sudden death of palms."
                      }
                    ],
                    "type": "list_item"
                  },
                  {
                    "children": [
                      {
                        "text": "Minimize risk and encourage replanting and rejuvenation to make coconut farming remunerative."
                      }
