                    "text": "Skill Training: ",
                    "underline": true
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "The program provides skill training to beneficiaries in a variety of sectors, including agriculture, construction, retail, and hospitality. The training is designed to be industry-relevant and to equip beneficiaries with the skills they need to secure employment."
