                    {
                      "text": " The National Trust to begin the fund disbursement process for providing setup cost to the ROs."
                    }
                  ],
                  "type": "paragraph"
                },
                {
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "text": "The National Trust should proactively reach out to the NGOs or ROs who had earlier approached for the Aspiration scheme. "
