        "benefits_md": "\n- Customized and industry-relevant training specific to the needs of each &#39;divyang&#39; group.\n- Skill development in high-growth sectors, including Information Technology, Animation, Visual Effects, Gaming and Comics (AVGC), Hospitality, and Food and Beverages.\n- Access to task-oriented and process-driven job roles suitable for Persons with Disabilities.\n- Support for securing dignified livelihood opportunities.\n- A budgetary allocation of \u20b92,00,00,00,000/- for the fiscal year 2026-27 to support the training initiatives.\n\n<br>\n\n",
        "briefDescription": "The scheme aims to ensure dignified livelihood opportunities for Persons with Disabilities (PwDs) by providing industry-relevant and customized training specific to each group. The scheme provides skill development in high-growth sectors such as Information Technology, Animation, Visual Effect, etc.",
