          "answer_md": "It is designed to integrate existing markets across the country into a single online system, enabling unified trading for agricultural commodities and promoting \u201cOne Nation One Market.\u201d\n<br>\n\n",
          "question": "What is the purpose of this online trading platform for agricultural markets?"
        },
        {
          "answer": [
            {
              "children": [
                {
                  "text": "It enables real-time price discovery through e-auctions and e-trading based on demand and supply, helping farmers secure better prices."
