          ],
          "answer_md": "It enables real-time price discovery through e-auctions and e-trading based on demand and supply, helping farmers secure better prices.\n<br>\n\n",
          "question": "How does this platform improve price discovery for farmers?"
        },
        {
          "answer": [
            {
              "children": [
                {
                  "text": "It offers clear, online auction processes, quality testing results, and direct electronic payments, reducing the scope for manipulation or hidden charges."
