              ],
              "type": "paragraph"
            }
          ],
          "answer_md": "It offers clear, online auction processes, quality testing results, and direct electronic payments, reducing the scope for manipulation or hidden charges.\n<br>\n\n",
          "question": "How does the system ensure transparency in agricultural trade?"
        },
        {
          "answer": [
            {
              "children": [
                {
                  "text": "Farmers get single-window services including commodity arrival details, quality assaying, e-bidding for price discovery, and direct e-payment to their bank accounts."
