          ],
          "answer_md": "The scheme-component aims to provide financial assistance to Below Poverty Line cancer patients for treatment.\n<br>\n\n",
          "question": "What is the objective of the \"Health Minister\u2019s Cancer Patient Fund\" scheme-component?"
        },
        {
          "answer": [
            {
              "children": [
                {
                  "text": "Patients living Below Poverty Line and suffering from cancer can apply."
                }
              ],
              "type": "paragraph"
            },
            {
              "children": [
                {
                  "text": ""
                }
              ],
              "type": "paragraph"
            }
          ],
          "answer_md": "Patients living Below Poverty Line and suffering from cancer can apply.\n<br>\n\n",
          "question": "Who can apply for this scheme?"
        },
        {
          "answer": [
            {
              "children": [
                {
                  "text": "The applicant can receive up to \u20b92,00,000/-, or \u20b95,00,000/- in emergency cases. Maximum financial assistance admissible under the Scheme will be \u20b915,00,000/-."
                }
              ],
              "type": "paragraph"
            },
            {
              "children": [
                {
                  "text": ""
                }
              ],
              "type": "paragraph"
            }
          ],
          "answer_md": "The applicant can receive up to \u20b92,00,000/-, or \u20b95,00,000/- in emergency cases. Maximum financial assistance admissible under the Scheme will be \u20b915,00,000/-.\n<br>\n\n",
          "question": "What is the maximum financial assistance available?"
        },
        {
          "answer": [
            {
              "children": [
                {
                  "text": "The treatment must be taken at designated Regional Cancer Centres."
                }
              ],
              "type": "paragraph"
            },
            {
              "children": [
                {
                  "text": ""
                }
              ],
              "type": "paragraph"
            }
          ],
          "answer_md": "The treatment must be taken at designated Regional Cancer Centres.\n<br>\n\n",
          "question": "Where can the treatment be taken under this scheme?"
        },
        {
          "answer": [
            {
              "children": [
                {
                  "text": "Government and PSU employees are not eligible for assistance."
                }
              ],
              "type": "paragraph"
            },
            {
              "children": [
