          "answer_md": "Government and PSU employees are not eligible for assistance.\n<br>\n\n",
          "question": "Are government employees eligible for this scheme?"
        },
        {
          "answer": [
            {
              "children": [
                {
                  "text": "Such cases are forwarded to the Ministry for further approval."
                }
              ],
              "type": "paragraph"
            },
            {
              "children": [
                {
                  "text": ""
                }
              ],
              "type": "paragraph"
            }
          ],
          "answer_md": "Such cases are forwarded to the Ministry for further approval.\n<br>\n\n",
          "question": "What happens if treatment cost exceeds \u20b92,00,000?"
        },
        {
          "answer": [
            {
              "children": [
                {
                  "text": "The assistance is provided through Regional Cancer Centres using revolving funds."
                }
              ],
              "type": "paragraph"
            },
            {
              "children": [
                {
                  "text": ""
                }
              ],
              "type": "paragraph"
            }
          ],
          "answer_md": "The assistance is provided through Regional Cancer Centres using revolving funds.\n<br>\n\n",
          "question": "How is the assistance provided?"
        },
        {
          "answer": [
            {
              "children": [
                {
                  "text": "It is a pre-allocated fund at RCCs to ensure quick disbursement of assistance."
                }
              ],
              "type": "paragraph"
            },
            {
              "children": [
                {
                  "text": ""
                }
              ],
              "type": "paragraph"
            }
          ],
          "answer_md": "It is a pre-allocated fund at RCCs to ensure quick disbursement of assistance.\n<br>\n\n",
          "question": "What is a revolving fund in this scheme?"
        },
        {
          "answer": [
            {
              "children": [
                {
                  "text": "Yes, emergency cases can receive up to \u20b95,00,000."
                }
              ],
              "type": "paragraph"
            },
            {
              "children": [
                {
                  "text": ""
                }
              ],
              "type": "paragraph"
            }
          ],
          "answer_md": "Yes, emergency cases can receive up to \u20b95,00,000.\n<br>\n\n",
          "question": "Is emergency assistance available under this scheme?"
        },
        {
          "answer": [
            {
              "children": [
                {
                  "text": "No, assistance is not provided if treatment is available free of cost."
                }
              ],
              "type": "paragraph"
            },
            {
              "children": [
                {
                  "text": ""
                }
              ],
              "type": "paragraph"
