          ],
          "answer_md": "No, assistance is not provided if treatment is available free of cost.\n<br>\n\n",
          "question": "Can assistance be used if treatment is free elsewhere?"
        },
        {
          "answer": [
            {
              "children": [
                {
                  "text": "The scheme covers 27 Regional Cancer Centres."
                }
              ],
              "type": "paragraph"
            },
            {
              "children": [
                {
                  "text": ""
                }
              ],
              "type": "paragraph"
            }
          ],
          "answer_md": "The scheme covers 27 Regional Cancer Centres.\n<br>\n\n",
          "question": "How many RCCs are covered under the scheme?"
        },
        {
          "answer": [
            {
              "children": [
                {
                  "text": "Assistance is processed quickly at RCC level due to revolving funds."
