                ],
                "type": "list_item"
              },
              {
                "align": "justify",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "text": "The upper age limit would be 30 years as of the date of the examination. For SC/ST & PH categories, the upper age limit will be relaxed by 5 years. For OBC the upper age limit will be relaxed by 3 years. For in-service candidates of Agricultural Universities (AU), the upper age limit would be 45 years as of the date of examination whereas, the academic performance requirement would remain as stated above. "
                  }
                ],
                "type": "list_item"
              }
            ],
