        "benefits_md": "\n  - **Monthly Fellowship:** \u20b965,000/- per month along with HRA and NPA as per Government rules.  - **Contingency Grant:** \u20b93,00,000/- per year for research-related expenses.  - **Travel Support:** Up to 25% of the contingency grant for national travel related to research work.  - **Tenure Duration:** 2 years, extendable by 1 more year based on performance.  - **Refund Clause:** Fellowship amount must be refunded if leaving before 1 year.  - **Fund Disbursement:** Fellowship and contingency grants are released every six months.  - **Accommodation Facility:** Accommodation may be provided (HRA not applicable if provided).  - **Medical &amp;amp; Leave Benefits:** As per ICMR rules for fellows.\n<br>\n\n",
        "briefDescription": "ICMR- Post Doctoral Fellowship (ICMR-PDF) Scheme is being instituted to foster high-quality research opportunities for promising fresh Ph.D./MD/MS holders in the areas of basic science, communicable and non-communicable diseases, & reproductive health including nutrition at ICMR Institutes/Centers.",
        "detailedDescription": [
          {
            "children": [
              {
                "children": [
                  {
                    "text": "The \"ICMR Post Doctoral Fellowship (ICMR-PDF)\" scheme implemented by the Indian Council of Medical Research, Ministry of Health & Family Welfare, aims to promote advanced research in health sciences. It provides opportunities to fresh PhD, MD, or MS holders to work in ICMR institutes and centres. The scheme focuses on research in areas like basic science, communicable and non-communicable diseases, reproductive health, and nutrition. Every year, around 50 fellowships are awarded to deserving candidates. Fellows get access to modern research facilities and expert guidance at ICMR institutions. The aim is to strengthen high-quality research and build skilled professionals in the health sector."
