          ],
          "answer_md": "ICMR- Post Doctoral Fellowship (ICMR-PDF) Scheme is being instituted to foster high-quality research opportunities for promising fresh Ph.D./MD/MS holders in the cutting-edge areas of basic science, communicable and non-communicable diseases, and reproductive health including nutrition at ICMR Institutes /Centers.\n",
          "question": "What is the \u201cICMR- Post Doctoral Fellowship\u201d Scheme?"
