          "answer_md": "Indian Council of Medical Research, Government of India\n",
          "question": "Which is the implementing agency of this scheme?"
        },
        {
          "answer": [
            {
              "children": [
                {
                  "text": "Fresh PhDs/MD/MS within three years of completing their Ph.D./MD/MS degree (awarded) as on the last date of the application and also those who have received their provisional Ph.D./MD/MS degree can apply."
