          "answer_md": "The PDF Guide should have the minimum designation of Scientist-C grade.\n",
          "question": "What should be the minimum designation of PDF Guide?"
        },
        {
          "answer": [
            {
              "children": [
                {
                  "text": "ICMR-PDFs will be paid a consolidated fellowship of \u20b965,000/- per month plus House Rent Allowance (HRA) as per Govt. of India rule and Non-Practicing allowance (NPA) as admissible."
