          "process_md": "**Step 01:** Applicants can apply online through the UMANG App or the official [National Social Assistance Programme (NSAP) Portal. ](https://www.dord.gov.in/offerings/schemes-and-services/details/national-social-assistance-programme-nsap-wN1cTNtQWa)\n**Step 02:** Login using the registered mobile number and OTP/MPIN.\n**Step 03:** Search for \u201cNSAP\u201d or \u201cIndira Gandhi National Disability Pension Scheme (IGNDPS)\u201d.\n**Step 04:** Click on \u201cApply Online\u201d.\n**Step 05:** Fill in the required details such as personal information, Aadhaar number, bank account details, and disability-related information.\n**Step 06:** Choose the preferred mode of pension payment.\n**Step 07:** Upload the required documents and photograph.\n**Step 08:** Review the application details and click on \u201cSubmit\u201d to complete the application process.\n**Step 09:** Applicants may also track the application and beneficiary payment status through the UMANG platform.\n<br>\n\n",
