        "benefits_md": "\n- A pension of \u20b9300/- per month is provided to Divyangjan between 18-79 years. \n- A pension of \u20b9500/- per month will be provided to Divyangjan aged 80 years and above. \n\n<br>\n\n",
        "briefDescription": "The scheme aims to provide social security pensions to divyangjans aged 18 and above who belong to a poor family (BPL) in society.\n\n",
