                    "text": "The scheme \u201cInstitutional Support for Development and Marketing of Tribal Products/Produce\u201d was introduced in 2014-15 by the Ministry of Tribal Affairs, Government of India. The scheme is implemented by revising and merging existing two separate schemes - \"Market Development of Tribal Products/Produce\" and \"Grant-in-Aid to State Tribal Development Cooperative Corporation for Minor Forest Produce Operation\"."
