        "briefDescription": "The Indian Veterinary Research Institute will award scholarships to MVSc and PhD students who need financial assistance.his provision will be utilized to assist as many students as possible who have good academic record and who are making diligent efforts to pursue higher education. ",
        "detailedDescription": [
          {
            "children": [
              {
                "text": "IVRI Institute Scholarship for M.V.Sc. and Ph.D. \u2013 The Indian Council of Agricultural Research under the Ministry of Agriculture and Farmers Welfare provides this scholarship for students pursuing M.V.Sc. and Ph.D. programmes at the Indian Veterinary Research Institute. The scholarship is admissible only to candidates admitted through a competitive entrance examination for M.V.Sc. and Ph.D. degree programmes. The scholarship for fresh students is awarded by the Joint Director (Academic) on the recommendation of the Standing Committee on Scholarship, Financial Assistance, and Academic Progress, which considers the merit of each applicant based initially on admission performance and subsequently on academic performance at the Institute."
