{
  "core": {
    "_id": "68b55e76362154c31e1b48cb",
    "en": {
      "applicationProcess": [
        {
          "mode": "Offline",
          "process": [
            {
              "children": [
                {
                  "bold": true,
                  "text": "Step 1:",
                  "underline": true
                },
                {
                  "bold": true,
                  "text": " "
                },
                {
                  "bold": true,
                  "italic": true,
                  "text": "Identification and Registration of Beneficiary"
                }
              ],
              "type": "paragraph"
            },
            {
              "children": [
                {
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "text": "An Accredited Social Health Activist, Auxiliary Nurse Midwife, Anganwadi Worker, or any designated link worker will identify and register the pregnant woman as a beneficiary of the scheme."
                    }
                  ],
                  "type": "list_item"
                },
                {
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "text": "This crucial step should be completed at least 20 to 24 weeks before the expected date of delivery to ensure timely access to benefits and services."
                    }
                  ],
                  "type": "list_item"
                }
              ],
              "type": "ul_list"
            },
            {
              "children": [
                {
                  "bold": true,
                  "text": "Step 2:",
                  "underline": true
                },
                {
                  "bold": true,
                  "text": " "
                },
                {
                  "bold": true,
                  "italic": true,
                  "text": "Maternal and Child Health Card Filling"
                }
              ],
              "type": "paragraph"
            },
            {
              "children": [
                {
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "text": "Immediately upon successful registration, the Auxiliary Nurse Midwife, Accredited Social Health Activist, Anganwadi Worker, or an equivalent link worker will accurately complete a Maternal and Child Health card. "
                    }
                  ],
                  "type": "list_item"
                },
                {
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "text": "This card is issued in duplicate, with one copy provided to the mother and the other retained by the link worker, forming an essential part of the Janani Suraksha Yojana registration."
                    }
                  ],
                  "type": "list_item"
                }
              ],
              "type": "ul_list"
            },
            {
              "children": [
                {
                  "bold": true,
                  "text": "Step 3:",
                  "underline": true
                },
                {
                  "bold": true,
                  "text": " "
                },
                {
                  "bold": true,
                  "italic": true,
                  "text": "Antenatal Care Information and Planning"
                }
              ],
              "type": "paragraph"
            },
            {
              "children": [
                {
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "text": "The designated link worker will inform the applicant about the schedule for at least three antenatal care check-ups and the required Tetanus Toxoid injections, ensuring these services are provided."
                    }
                  ],
                  "type": "list_item"
                },
                {
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "text": "Furthermore, they will clearly identify and communicate the health center for all necessary referrals and the predetermined place of delivery, along with the expected date of delivery."
                    }
                  ],
                  "type": "list_item"
                },
                {
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "text": "The Accredited Social Health Activist is responsible for following up on antenatal care visits at Anganwadi Centres or Sub-centers to ensure the beneficiary's attendance."
                    }
                  ],
                  "type": "list_item"
                }
              ],
              "type": "ul_list"
            },
            {
              "children": [
                {
                  "bold": true,
                  "text": "Step 4:",
                  "underline": true
                },
                {
                  "bold": true,
                  "text": " "
                },
                {
                  "bold": true,
                  "italic": true,
                  "text": "Collection of Necessary Proofs/Certificates"
                }
              ],
              "type": "paragraph"
            },
            {
              "children": [
                {
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "text": "If required by the specific eligibility criteria, the Accredited Social Health Activist, Auxiliary Nurse Midwife, Anganwadi Worker, or a link worker will assist the applicant in collecting the necessary Below Poverty Line or other relevant proofs and certificates from the local Panchayat, local bodies, or Municipalities. "
                    }
                  ],
                  "type": "list_item"
                },
                {
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "text": "This step should be completed within two to four weeks from the initial registration date."
                    }
                  ],
                  "type": "list_item"
                }
              ],
              "type": "ul_list"
            },
            {
              "children": [
                {
                  "bold": true,
                  "text": "Step 5:",
                  "underline": true
                },
                {
                  "bold": true,
                  "text": " "
                },
