        "eligibilityDescription_md": "\n1. Farmers - individual/joint borrowers who are owner cultivators;\n1. Tenant farmers, oral lessees &amp; share croppers;\n1. Self Help Groups (SHGs) or Joint Liability Groups (JLGs) of farmers including tenant farmers, share croppers etc\n\n<br>\n\n"
