        "benefits_md": "> **Long-Term Fellowship (6-12 months) in Indian institutes:**\n\n\n  - **Monthly Stipend:** \u20b940,000/- per month (different station); \u20b920,000/- per month (same station).  - **Travel Allowance:** As per the parent organization&amp;#39;s T.A. rules.  - **Contingency Grant:** \u20b930,000/- (maximum) for local expenses; \u20b920,000/- for attending progress review meetings.\n&gt; **Long-Term Fellowship (6-12 months) in Foreign institutes:**\n\n\n  - **Monthly Stipend:** US $3000/- per month (or equivalent currency).  - **Air Travel:** Economy class airfare by Air India via the shortest route.  - **Contingency Grant:** \u20b950,000/- (maximum) for visa, insurance, local expenses; \u20b920,000/- for review meetings.  - **Conference Grant:** US $600 (up to 6 months) or US $1200 (6\u201312 months).\n<br>\n\n",
