          "answer_md": "Under Credit Line\u20131, the rate is 7% per annum.\nUnder Credit Line\u20132, the rate is 10% for male beneficiaries and 8% for female beneficiaries.\nThe repayment period is three years, with a moratorium of three months.\n<br>\n\n",
