        "detailedDescription_md": "The objective of the National Award for Excellence in Vocational Training &amp; Entrepreneurship Development, under the Ministry of Skill Development and Entrepreneurship, Government of India, is to honor excellence among faculty, trainers, and master trainers in long-term and short-term training as well as entrepreneurship development, who have achieved outstanding performance and set benchmarks for others to emulate.\n**No. of Awardees**\n**A total of sixteen awards will be conferred each year.  There shall be five award categories as per the details below:**\n\n1. Category I: Best Skill Trainers \u2013 Long Term Training (09 Awards)\n1. Sub Category (i): Best Skill Trainer in top 5 trades under CTS in ITIs  - 05\n1. Sub Category (ii): Best Skill Trainer in remaining engineering trades - 01\n1. Sub Category (iii): Best Skill Trainer in remaining non-engineering trades  -  01\n1. Sub Category (iv): Best Skill Trainer Divyang trades  - 01\n1. Sub Category (v): Best Skill Trainer New Age Courses - 01\n1. Category II: Best Skill Trainers \u2013 Short Term Training (03 Awards)\n1. Category III: Best Master Trainers - Long Term Training (02 Awards)   \n1. Sub Category (i): Best Master Trainer in Engineering trades  - 01\n1. Sub Category (ii):Best Master Trainer in Non-Engineering trades - 01\n1. Category IV: Best Master Trainers - Short Term Training (01 Award)\n1. Category V: Excellence in Entrepreneurship Development (01 Award)\n\n<br>\n\n",
