              ],
              "type": "paragraph"
            },
            {
              "children": [
                {
                  "text": "If no option of either exit or shift to NPS is chosen by the age 21, the account automatically shifts to NPS in a higher-equity scheme under Multiple Scheme Framework, under the same Pension Fund and thereafter terms and conditions of NPS shall apply. Withdrawals will only be allowed after KYC is completed."
