          "answer_md": "In the case of the death of the minor subscriber, the entire accumulated corpus is to be paid to the guardian or nominee(s) or legal heir(s), as the case may be. The recipient shall also have the option to transfer the proceeds to their individual NPS account.\n<br>\n\n",
