                  "text": "Subscriber grievances can be lodged through the Central Grievance Management System (CGMS) of the respective CRA, as notified under the PFRDA (Redressal of Subscriber Grievance) Regulations, 2015. Grievances can be lodged through the NPS Trust website. PFRDA has developed an integrated grievance management portal, "
