            "type": "paragraph"
          },
          {
            "children": [
              {
                "text": "b) Indira Gandhi National Widow Pension Scheme (IGNWPS)"
              }
            ],
            "type": "paragraph"
          },
          {
            "children": [
              {
                "text": "c) Indira Gandhi National Disability Pension Scheme (IGNDPS)"
              }
            ],
            "type": "paragraph"
          },
          {
            "children": [
              {
                "text": "d) National Family Benefit Scheme (NFBS)"
              }
            ],
            "type": "paragraph"
          },
          {
            "children": [
              {
                "text": "e) Annapurna Scheme"
              }
            ],
            "type": "paragraph"
          },
          {
            "children": [
              {
                "bold": true,
                "text": "Objectives of NSAP- "
              }
            ],
            "type": "block_quote"
          },
          {
            "children": [
              {
                "text": "1. Provides social assistance benefits to poor households in the case of death, maternity, or old age of the breadwinner."
              }
            ],
            "type": "paragraph"
          },
          {
            "children": [
              {
                "text": "2. Ensure minimum national standards, in addition to the benefits that the states are currently providing or might provide in the future."
              }
            ],
            "type": "paragraph"
          },
          {
            "children": [
              {
                "text": "3. Ensure uniform social protection for the beneficiaries across the country without interruption."
              }
            ],
            "type": "paragraph"
          },
          {
            "children": [
              {
                "bold": true,
                "text": "Expansion to cover all eligible BPL persons- "
              }
            ],
