          "answer_md": "To facilitate the construction and running of an Anganwadi Centre, the existing population norms have been changed to require a minimum habitation population of 100 and above.\n<br>\n\n",
          "question": "If my habitation is seeking the installation and operation of a new Anganwadi Centre facility, what is the modified minimum population requirement for its establishment?"
