                  {
                    "text": "Financial Assistance of \u20b9 1,20,000 per unit for plain areas; and \u20b9 1,30,000 per unit for hilly areas, difficult areas, and IAP districts (Himalayan states, North-Eastern states, and Union Territories of Jammu & Kashmir)."
