              },
              {
                "children": [
                  {
                    "text": "In convergence with Swachh Bharat Mission-Gramin (SBM-G), the beneficiaries get financial assistance of up to \u20b9 12,000 for the construction of toilets."
                  }
                ],
                "type": "list_item"
              },
              {
                "children": [
                  {
                    "text": "In convergence with MGNREGA, the beneficiary is entitled to employment as unskilled labor (Rural Mason Training) at \u20b9 90.95 per day for 95 days."
                  }
                ],
                "type": "list_item"
              },
              {
                "children": [
                  {
                    "text": "In convergence with Pradhan Mantri Ujjwala Yojana, one LPG connection per house is provided."
                  }
                ],
                "type": "list_item"
              },
              {
                "children": [
                  {
                    "text": "Convergence with different government programmes for piped drinking water, electricity connection, clean & efficient cooking fuel, treatment of social and liquid waste, etc."
