                  "text": "There are two ways in which the applicant can check his/her application status:\nMethod-1: Using Assessment ID.\nStep 1: Log on to the Pradhan Mantri Awas Yojana website: http://pmaymis.gov.in/Track_Application_Status.aspx or go to the \u2018Citizen Application\u2019 option and then choose the \u2018Check Status\u2019 button.\nStep 2: When you hit the track button, there will be two options displayed: \u2018By Name, Father's Name & Mobile No\u2019 and \u2018By Assessment ID\u2019.\nStep 3: Choose the \u2018By Assessment ID\u2019 option.\nStep 4: Enter the Assessment ID & Mobile Number that was assigned when the form was filled and submitted.\nStep 5: After filling in the details, click \u2018Submit\u2019.\nStep 6: The user can view the progress of his/her application.\n \n\nMethod-2: Using Name, Father's Name and Mobile Number.\nStep 1: Log on to the Pradhan Mantri Awas Yojana website (pmaymis.gov.in) and go to the \u2018Citizen Application\u2019 option and then choose the \u2018Check Status\u2019 button.\nStep 2: After clicking on the know your status button, choose the \u2018By Name, Father's Name & Mobile No\u2019 option.\nStep 3: Once this is done, provide the State, District and City details.\nStep 4: The next step is to fill in the Name, Father\u2019s name and Mobile Number.\nStep 5: Once this done, Click 'Submit'.\nStep 6: Once this done, the status can be viewed."
