        "benefits": [
          {
            "children": [
              {
                "align": "justify",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "bold": true,
                    "text": "Basic Savings Bank Deposit Account (BSBDA)",
                    "underline": true
                  }
                ],
                "type": "paragraph"
              },
              {
                "align": "justify",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "text": "Any Indian citizen eligible to open a regular bank account can open a BSBDA. Such an account does not require any minimum balance maintenance. The account holders can use both bank branches, ATMs and Banking Correspondents (BCs) for depositing and withdrawing cash. However, one cannot withdraw cash more than four times a month."
                  }
                ],
                "type": "paragraph"
              },
              {
                "align": "justify",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "bold": true,
                    "text": "Small Account/Chota Khata",
                    "underline": true
                  }
                ],
                "type": "paragraph"
              },
              {
                "align": "justify",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "text": "Under Jan Dhan Yojana, people can open small bank accounts without presenting legal documents. These accounts would be valid normally for a period of twelve months. Thereafter, such accounts  would be allowed to a continue for a further period of twelve more months, if the account-holder provides a document showing that he/she has applied for any of the Officially Valid Document, within 12 months of opening the small account."
                  }
                ],
                "type": "paragraph"
              },
              {
                "align": "justify",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "bold": true,
                    "text": "RuPay Debit Card with inbuilt accident insurance",
                    "underline": true
                  }
                ],
                "type": "paragraph"
              },
              {
                "align": "justify",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "text": "Under PMJDY,  a free Rupay debit card,  with inbuilt accident insurance cover of Rs.2 lakhs (Rs 1 lakh for accounts opened before 28.08.2018),  is issued to all beneficiaries. "
                  }
                ],
                "type": "paragraph"
              },
              {
                "align": "justify",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "bold": true,
                    "text": "Overdraft Facility",
                    "underline": true
                  }
                ],
                "type": "paragraph"
              },
              {
                "align": "justify",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "text": "Under PMJDY, beneficiaries can avail OD facility upto Rs. 10,000/-."
