        "eligibilityDescription_md": "\n  - **MSP Support:** Fixation and procurement of non-nationalised, non-timber Minor Forest Produce (MFPs) to ensure a fair price to tribal gatherers.  - **Infrastructure Development:** Creation and development of Haat Bazars, storage godowns, and other facilities, including special projects for tribal trade and storage.  - **Value Addition:** Support for processing and value addition to various MFPs, non-MFPs, and other tribal produce/products to enhance income.  - **Enterprise Creation:** Establishment of Van Dhan Vikas Kendras (VDVKs) and Van Dhan Producer Enterprises (VDPEs) for organised tribal business activities.  - **Marketing Support:** Facilitation of sale and purchase of products made by VDVKs/VDPEs and other tribal products such as handloom and handicrafts.  - **Branding &amp;amp; Promotion:** Advertisement, branding, and promotion of tribal products through participation in festivals, exhibitions, tribal artisan melas, and Mahotsavas.  - **Skill &amp;amp; Entrepreneurship Development:** Training and capacity building for tribal beneficiaries to develop skills and entrepreneurial capabilities.  - **Geo-Tagging of Assets:** Geo-tagging of VDVKs, VDPEs, and other assets created under the scheme for better monitoring and tracking.  - **Geographical Indication Support:** Promotion and support for Geographical Indication (GI) tagging of tribal produce/products.  - **IT &amp;amp; E-Commerce Development:** Building and upgradation of IT infrastructure, e-commerce platforms, and digitisation of operations.  - **Beneficiary Survey:** Conducting surveys for the identification, assessment, and monitoring of beneficiaries.  - **Research &amp;amp; Development:** Support for research and development activities to improve tribal products and processes.\n<br>\n\n"
