          "answer_md": "Establishments with a baseline of 50 or more employees are required to generate at least 5 additional employments over and above their baseline to trigger the employer incentives.\n<br>\n\n",
          "question": "If our manufacturing firm already employs over sixty individuals on average, how many extra sustained positions must we successfully generate above our usual staffing levels to participate in the employment creation initiative?"
        },
        {
          "answer": [
            {
              "children": [
                {
                  "text": "Workers in seasonal industries must continue with the exact same establishment for the entire continuous period of 6 months to fulfill the eligibility criteria for the initial payment."
