          ],
          "answer_md": "Workers in seasonal industries must continue with the exact same establishment for the entire continuous period of 6 months to fulfill the eligibility criteria for the initial payment.\n<br>\n\n",
          "question": "For those of us who are taking up initial employment in a sector that only operates during certain seasons of the year, what are the specific criteria regarding continuous work to qualify for the first installment?"
