        "detailedDescription_md": "Surakshit Matritva Aashwasan Yojana (SUMAN) is a maternity benefit initiative launched by the Ministry of Health and Family Welfare. The scheme aims to provide affordable, high-quality healthcare solutions to pregnant women and newborns. Under this scheme, ensuring assured, dignified, respectful, and quality healthcare services at zero cost for all pregnant women, mothers, and newborns visiting public health facilities.\n**Objectives of the SUMAN scheme:**\n\n- To achieve zero preventable maternal and newborn deaths.\n- To ensure assured, free, and quality healthcare services for every pregnant woman and newborn.\n- To provide dignified and respectful care, maintaining privacy and confidentiality.\n- To enforce zero tolerance for denial of services at public health facilities.\n- To ensure comprehensive maternal and newborn care, including antenatal, delivery, and postnatal services.\n\n<br>\n\n",
